      "cr": 0.25,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Liberated Toads cohort sheet — Recon T.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-liberated-toads-actors.py</code> from the Pond Patrol docket (<code>data/liberatedToadsSystem.json</code>, snapshot Highsun 24, 1040 BF): level 3 on the docket → CR 1/4 as spy (masters of deception, infiltration, and information gathering); scout leathers (AC 13), hit points 3d8 + 3. A GM-ready reading of the docket, not a filed stat line; the docket stays the authority.</p><p><strong>The Scouts</strong> — Reconnaissance, infiltration, information gathering, early warning. Leader: VACANT. Reeling from the revelation that their previous leader was an Iron Legion mole. Many question if other spies remain.</p><p><strong>On the docket:</strong> Long-route eyes, level 3 (a T-pun name). <q>Returns with news or not at all.</q></p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Equipment</strong> — Stealth gear, Communication devices, Disguises (the weapon items)</li><li><strong>Specialisations</strong> — Reconnaissance, Infiltration, Signals (the cohort feat)</li><li><strong>Spy</strong> — classDefinitions.spy: Expertise (L1); False Identity (L1); Silver Tongue (L2); Dead Drop (L3); Read the Room (L3)</li><li><strong>Status</strong> — compromised: Previous leader was Iron Legion mole; trust shattered</li></ul>",
        "public": ""
      },
